{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"815b51a0b82a0e346131a9876288ec39a7c5d32293b9db595b6d89f16b59175a","digest":{"component_or_area":"M2M outbound reconciler (outbound_differ, applier, run_differs)","key_entities":["outbound_differ._compute_outbound_create_mutation","outbound_differ.py:585","applier._cross_project_targets","applier.py:247-262","applier.py:618","apply_inbound_records","run_differs._run_differs_outbound","run_differs.py:471","projects_store.load_mapping","projects_store.resolve_project","read_projects","projects.json","_BRIDGE_TARGET_PROJECT_KEY","test_applier_cross_project_guard.py","test_outbound_multi_project.py"],"problem_keywords":["case-sensitivity","project membership","m2m outbound","guard wiring","test coverage","correctness","applier","reconciliation"],"propositions":["The create-path membership test in outbound_differ is case-sensitive while the applier guard normalizes to uppercase, causing disagreement when bridge_project differs only in case from a mapping key.","The applier guard store-loading wiring through read_projects(repo_root) is only unit-tested at the pure-helper level and lacks an end-to-end test driving apply() with a seeded projects.json.","The run_differs outbound seam does not have a test proving that a malformed projects.json fails closed by propagating ValueError from load_mapping.","The outbound reconciliation reads projects.json twice per pass (load_mapping in create resolution and read_projects in applier guard), risking mid-pass disagreement if the file changes."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787716715062